# Module domain

[docs/modules/domain-architecture.md](../../docs/modules/domain-architecture.md) · [ui-tree.md](../../docs/modules/ui-tree.md) · [organism-components.md](../../docs/modules/organism-components.md)

Domain code stays in `@modules/<slug>`; server-first; client at leaves. **Building screen UI:** read [organism-components.md](../../docs/modules/organism-components.md) first (Cursor: `module-organism-components.mdc`).

Each product capability owns a standalone `modules/<slug>` directory. **MUST NOT** create nested domain/submodule folders under a module; group files by technical responsibility inside that module. Import sibling modules through their public entry points.
